# Cross-platform line endings: keep text files LF everywhere so the Makefile,
# shell scripts, and Docker/compose files run on Windows (Git Bash / WSL) and
# macOS/Linux alike. Without this, a Windows checkout can rewrite them to CRLF
# and bash fails with `\r`-not-found errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.hbc  binary
